<h2>Multi-Tier Regression Test Architecture</h2>
<p>
    The platform's reliability is guaranteed by <b>seven dedicated test runners</b> executing in OpenJDK 21:
</p>
<ol>
    <li>
        <b>SyntheticBenchmarkRunner (56 Cases):</b> Evaluates natural language triage, contrastive clause parsing, and urgency drivers against 56 diverse municipal scenarios.
    </li>
    <li>
        <b>DuplicateDetectionBenchmarkTest (12 Pairs):</b> Validates Jaccard, TF-IDF cosine, and containment scoring against 6 positive and 6 negative pairs.
    </li>
    <li>
        <b>SlaEngineIntegrationTest (19 Checks):</b> Validates category-specific policy binding, 6-state mapping, idempotent escalation, and downtime recovery.
    </li>
    <li>
        <b>LifecycleIntegrationTest (17 Checks):</b> Validates the 7-state finite state machine, mandatory resolution evidence, and citizen appeals.
    </li>
    <li>
        <b>CivicLensMasterTestSuite (16 Checks across 6 Tiers):</b> The definitive end-to-end integration test verifying RBAC, triage, duplicates, SLA, lifecycle, and analytics.
    </li>
    <li>
        <b>ReviewerAdversarialTest (71 Checks):</b> Aggressive fuzzing and security test probing IDOR, SQL injection, illegal state jumps, and cross-user tampering.
    </li>
    <li>
        <b>ReviewM1Test (82 Checks):</b> Comprehensive static and functional verification of database schema integrity, connection pools, and core models.
    </li>
</ol>

